## Doesn't fire

These don't render as `<hr>`:

- `--` (fewer than 3) — falls through to plain text.
- `---x` (other characters on the line) — falls through to plain text.
- `- * -` (mixed marker characters) — falls through to plain text.
- `- - -` (whitespace BEFORE the first 3) — the literal-3-char `open` design requires the first 3 chars to be consecutive; the spaces-from-start case isn't supported.
- `    ---` (4+ leading spaces) — CommonMark indented-code position.

